; The stage-1 blockout: one room, a balcony over its right half, one flight of stairs.
; Grey primitives only — the kit is authored in this repository (ATTRIBUTION.md).
; Every grid row is exactly 24 cells wide; a space is a cell with no module.
; The arena stands on Greenholm, an island (FR-MAP-120, FR-GREENHOLM-010).
; The flight rises east along rows 12 and 13, two cells wide, eight steps of 0.375 m,
; into an opening three cells wide in the balcony's west wall: wide enough for the
; snake's body, which a single cell is not (ADR-0021) (FR-MAP-150, ADR-0033).

